      <description>&lt;style&gt;&#xA;p {line-height: 1.75; font-size: 16px;}&#xA;h1 {font-size: 24px; text-align: center;} &#xA;h2 {font-size: 22px;} &#xA;ul, ol {line-height: 1.5;}&#xA;&lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;contents&#34;&gt;Contents&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#employment&#34;&gt;Employment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#review&#34;&gt;Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#research-experience&#34;&gt;Research Experience&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;employment&#34;&gt;Employment&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;&#xA;  background-color: #f8f9fa;&#xA;  border-left: 5px solid #3498db;&#xA;  padding: 5px 10px;&#xA;  border-radius: 8px;&#xA;  margin-bottom: 30px;&#xA;  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Teaching Assistant ($66,033.99)&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Aug. 2025 – Present&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;College of Education, Purdue University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;EDPS 32700 Classroom Assessment&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Graduate Research Assistant ($64,650.00)&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Aug. 2024 – Jul. 2025&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;School of Engineering Education, Purdue University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Perform psychometrics and analyze data on existing data sets&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Develop, maintain, and refine CD-CAT algorithms&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Conduct simulation studies to support research development&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;review&#34;&gt;Review&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;&#xA;  background-color: #f8f9fa;&#xA;  border-left: 5px solid #3498db;&#xA;  padding: 5px 10px;&#xA;  border-radius: 8px;&#xA;  margin-bottom: 30px;&#xA;  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol style=&#34;padding-left: 25px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: -25px; padding-left: 25px;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Psychometrika (2025)&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: -25px; padding-left: 25px;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Journal of Computerized Adaptive Testing (2025)&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;research-experience&#34;&gt;Research Experience&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;&#xA;  background-color: #f8f9fa;&#xA;  border-left: 5px solid #3498db;&#xA;  padding: 5px 10px;&#xA;  border-radius: 8px;&#xA;  margin-bottom: 30px;&#xA;  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Research Assistant&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Dec. 2023 – Present&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;National Science Foundation Grant No. 2141847&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Lead CD-CAT parameter estimation and item-selection optimization&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Lead online calibration and CAT tuning procedures&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Support math CD development and psychometric refinement&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Assist &lt;a href=&#34;https://lassoeducation.org&#34; style=&#34;color: #2980b9; text-decoration: none;&#34;&gt;LASSO&lt;/a&gt; implementation data analysis&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Volunteer Consultant&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Dec. 2023 – Present&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Psychometric Investigation Laboratory, Purdue University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Offer consultation with statistical methods, software support, research design, data management and cleaning&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Deliver the Using Machine Learning to Analyze Educational Data presentation series in the Research Methods &amp; Statistics Workshop&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Suzhou&#39;s Micro Monitoring and Micro Investigation Project&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Apr. 2022 – Jun. 2023&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Education Psychology, East China Normal University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Collect and analyze data from middle school classroom interactions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Examine teacher-student interactions using classroom video data&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Optimizing the Teacher Training System of Clinical Pharmacist Project&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Jul. 2021 – Sept. 2021&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Chinese Hospital Association &amp; East China Normal University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Analyze factors influencing student satisfaction using ordinal logistic regression&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Advocate for a diversified, process-based assessment system&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Suzhou&#39;s Micro Monitoring and Micro Investigation Project&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Apr. 2021 – May. 2022&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Education Psychology, East China Normal University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Investigate the creativity and classroom creative climate of 4th and 8th grade students in Suzhou, China (4,833 students, 300 teachers, 48 schools)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Evaluate student creativity using the Rasch model and Wright map&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Analyze the relationship between students&#39; creative potential and academic achievement using multilevel linear models&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;National Education Science &#34;13th Five-Year Plan&#34; Project&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Dec. 2020 – Aug. 2023&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Education Psychology, East China Normal University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Explore the embedded assessment system oriented by key competencies&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Conduct literature reviews on conceptual understanding and contributed to the theoretical framework&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Research Assistant&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Sept. 2019 – Jun. 2020&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Surveys and Data Center, East China Normal University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Investigate the lifestyle of the urban residents in the Yangtze River Delta&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Analyze and cleaned large-scale survey data on the quality of life in Shanghai during the COVID-19 outbreak&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Co-author two journal papers in 2020&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Debug and update the center&#39;s official website&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Research Assistant&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Jul. 2018 – Dec. 2018&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Shanghai Science &amp; Education Promotion Center&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Complete three evaluation reports commissioned by the Shanghai Science &amp; Technology Museum, Shanghai Municipal Greening and City Appearance Administration, and Shanghai Statistics Bureau&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Recruit volunteers for five popular science education activities&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 5px;&#34;&gt;Shanghai Innovation and Entrepreneurship Project&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px;&#34;&gt;Sept. 2016 – Sept. 2017&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;color: #555; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;&#34;&gt;Statistics, East China Normal University&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul style=&#34;margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Explore the city&#39;s perception and evaluation of international students in China&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li style=&#34;margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px;&#34;&gt;Interview 17 international students in person and analyze data&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Jing Huang</title>
      <link>/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/</guid>
      <description>&lt;script src=&#34;/rmarkdown-libs/kePrint/kePrint.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;link href=&#34;/rmarkdown-libs/lightable/lightable.css&#34; rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;/rmarkdown-libs/kePrint/kePrint.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;link href=&#34;/rmarkdown-libs/lightable/lightable.css&#34; rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;style&gt;&#xA;/* Adjust general text line spacing */&#xA;p {line-height: 1.75; font-size: 16px;}&#xA;h1 {font-size: 22px; text-align: center;} &#xA;h2 {font-size: 22px; } &#xA;/* Adjust line spacing in numbered or bulleted lists */&#xA;ul, ol {line-height: 1.5;}&#xA;&lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;&#xA;    background-color: #f8f9fa;&#xA;    border-left: 5px solid #3498db;&#xA;    padding: 25px;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    margin-bottom: 30px;&#xA;    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&#34;margin-bottom: 0; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Welcome to my academic website! I am a Ph.D. candidate in &lt;strong style=&#34;color: #2980b9;&#34;&gt;Educational Psychology and Research Methodology&lt;/strong&gt; at Purdue University, working under the guidance of Professor &lt;strong style=&#34;color: #2980b9;&#34;&gt;Hua-Hua Chang&lt;/strong&gt;. My research focuses on psychometrics, educational measurement, statistical modeling, and large language models.&#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Publications</title>
      <link>/publications/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/publications/</guid>
